            ["Wettbewerber"] = "Wettbewärber",
            ["What is ordered and not yet here: open quantity per schedule line times unit value. Deliberately period-independent, across all years in the loaded SAP data so old backlogs do not disappear. Includes old backlogs still open in SAP. Purchase orders only, no quantity contracts."] = "What is ordered and not yet here: open quantity per schedule line times unit value. Deliberately period-independent, across all years in the loaded SAP data so old backlogs do not disappear. Includes old backlogs still open in SAP. Purchase orders only, no quantity contracts.",
            ["What is ordered and not yet here: open quantity per schedule line times unit value. Deliberately period-independent, as of today across all years so old backlogs do not disappear. That is why the amount exceeds a twelve-month view: on 27.08.2026 about two thirds had a delivery date before 2026. Purchase orders only, no quantity contracts."] = "What is ordered and not yet here: open quantity per schedule line times unit value. Deliberately period-independent, as of today across all years so old backlogs do not disappear. That is why the amount exceeds a twelve-month view: on 27.08.2026 about two thirds had a delivery date before 2026. Purchase orders only, no quantity contracts.",
            ["Wirkt auf Dashboard, Pruefbuch, zentrale Excel und Nachweis-Excel. Beschluss Andreas vom 27.08.2026: umrechnen ist die Regel."] = "Wirkt uf Dashboard, Prüefbuech, zentrali Excel u Nachwis-Excel. Bschluss Andreas vom 27.08.2026: umrächne isch d Regle.",
            ["Wirkt einheitlich auf alle CHF-Finance-Werte in Cockpit, Finance-Pivot, Pruefbuch, Nachweis-Excel und Sales_All. Der Tageskurs kann diese Werte bei jeder Neuberechnung aendern, der Jahresendkurs macht die Jahressicht reproduzierbar. Kursquelle und verbindlicher Stichtag der offiziellen Reportingumrechnung sind fachlich noch offen (ISS-008)."] = "Wirkt einheitlech uf aui CHF-Finance-Wärt i Cockpit, Finance-Pivot, Prüefbuech, Nachwis-Excel u Sales_All. Dr Tageskurs cha die Wärt bi jeder Neuberächnig ändere, dr Jahresändkurs macht d Jahressicht reproduzierbar. Kursquelle u verbindlechen Stichtag vo der offizielle Reportingumrächnig si fachlech no offe (ISS-008).",
